WEBVTT

00:00:02.730 --> 00:00:03.990
W–What?

00:00:06.790 --> 00:00:07.720
A baby?!

00:00:08.710 --> 00:00:10.540
Wait, stop!

00:00:16.420 --> 00:00:17.630
Ow-ow-ow...

00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:25.060
Um...

00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:34.670
Mama...

00:00:35.430 --> 00:00:38.040
<i>Whaaat</i>?!

00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:45.060
Get dance! Come to PriPara today, and

00:00:45.060 --> 00:00:51.760
Dance! The rainbow in your heart shines – an exciting neverland!

00:00:59.020 --> 00:01:04.250
Just wishing for something – that won't make it come true

00:01:04.250 --> 00:01:09.780
Soon you'll hear the melody of your heartbeat

00:01:09.780 --> 00:01:15.160
There are things you can't lose – don't ever let them go

00:01:15.160 --> 00:01:19.750
Let's start! This miraculous friendship is forever!

00:01:19.750 --> 00:01:25.510
Dream of live, honest feelings are the best

00:01:25.510 --> 00:01:28.840
Music that goes beyond words

00:01:28.840 --> 00:01:34.350
Don't let them go; embrace your happy days right now

00:01:34.350 --> 00:01:39.400
Crystal rainbow shower, a shooting star threads the sky

00:01:39.400 --> 00:01:45.360
It's your showtime, until you reach your destined stage

00:01:45.360 --> 00:01:50.490
Open the closet and meet your sparkling future

00:01:50.490 --> 00:01:56.450
You can even become a Divine Idol – go on and show me!

00:01:56.450 --> 00:01:59.120
Smile! The parade's ready, so come and

00:01:59.120 --> 00:02:06.470
Dance! The rainbow in your heart shines – an exciting neverland!

00:02:13.400 --> 00:02:16.350
Mama...

00:02:20.030 --> 00:02:23.510
Hey, no, I'm not your mama!

00:02:23.510 --> 00:02:24.970
I'm only in primary school!

00:02:35.580 --> 00:02:36.670
Mama...

00:02:36.780 --> 00:02:38.670
I told you: I'm not your mama!

00:02:41.130 --> 00:02:42.070
Where's the baby?

00:02:42.070 --> 00:02:43.150
There she is!

00:02:43.150 --> 00:02:43.990
Mama.

00:02:43.990 --> 00:02:44.780
No, I'm not!

00:02:48.620 --> 00:02:49.470
Mama!

00:02:49.470 --> 00:02:50.270
I am <i>not</i>!

00:02:52.070 --> 00:02:54.520
What should I do?

00:02:55.040 --> 00:02:57.400
All right, let's look for your real mother!

00:02:58.100 --> 00:02:59.220
Excuse me!

00:02:59.220 --> 00:03:02.110
Does this baby belong to someone here?

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:05.620
Did someone here lose a baby?

00:03:06.670 --> 00:03:07.850
There's no one here...

00:03:09.480 --> 00:03:13.140
Did... did she get a PriTicket and come here by herself?

00:03:13.530 --> 00:03:15.160
I'm talking crazy.

00:03:16.040 --> 00:03:18.840
So how <i>did</i> she fall from the sky, anyway?

00:03:19.660 --> 00:03:23.050
Hello? Is the mother of this baby around?

00:03:28.740 --> 00:03:30.330
What's going on-pri?

00:03:30.330 --> 00:03:33.110
What could "Divine Idol Grand Prix Mode" be?

00:03:33.710 --> 00:03:36.070
Update complete!

00:03:37.940 --> 00:03:39.190
It's bright again...

00:03:40.490 --> 00:03:41.540
Hey, what's that?

00:04:01.110 --> 00:04:02.670
Rosette Jewel...

00:04:02.670 --> 00:04:04.360
a new brand-pri?

00:04:04.500 --> 00:04:06.600
Could it be a coord for the stage?

00:04:06.760 --> 00:04:08.890
A coord made from stone?

00:04:09.260 --> 00:04:12.680
Mama? Is this baby's mama around?

00:04:12.950 --> 00:04:13.910
It's Lala!

00:04:14.010 --> 00:04:15.460
Just Where'd you go-pri?

00:04:15.710 --> 00:04:17.060
Hey, you guys.

00:04:17.060 --> 00:04:20.710
This baby fell from the sky, and now I'm looking for her mother.

00:04:20.950 --> 00:04:22.580
And which baby would that be?

00:04:22.790 --> 00:04:24.110
Hm? The one right...

00:04:27.160 --> 00:04:29.240
Wait, what?

00:04:32.440 --> 00:04:34.740
Hang on... why'd she disappear?

00:04:34.840 --> 00:04:36.810
Lala? You with us, Lala?

00:04:37.160 --> 00:04:39.630
Anyway, you're ignoring what's really important.

00:04:40.090 --> 00:04:42.320
Check out this sweet new mic!

00:04:42.660 --> 00:04:44.440
This statue and the new mic...

00:04:44.440 --> 00:04:47.640
do they bear some relation to this "Divine Idol Grand Prix"?

00:04:48.270 --> 00:04:50.720
Now, allow me to explain.

00:04:53.140 --> 00:04:55.020
Meganii Diving!

00:04:59.740 --> 00:05:00.340
And alight.

00:05:01.450 --> 00:05:02.490
Hello, all.

00:05:03.450 --> 00:05:04.110
Meganii!

00:05:04.110 --> 00:05:05.560
Meganii-sama!

00:05:05.690 --> 00:05:06.760
It's Meganii!

00:05:07.520 --> 00:05:09.240
I've just now returned from PriParis.

00:05:10.170 --> 00:05:12.250
My purpose for going was...

00:05:12.250 --> 00:05:14.970
to attend the worldwide Meganii Summit!

00:05:15.590 --> 00:05:17.050
And the agenda for this meeting...

00:05:18.150 --> 00:05:18.370
was the Divine Idol Grand Prix!

00:05:18.370 --> 00:05:20.920
Divine Idol Grand Prix

00:05:20.920 --> 00:05:22.540
The Divine Idol Grand Prix...

00:05:23.290 --> 00:05:27.200
Since the Saints' retirement, no Divine Idol has been come into being..

00:05:27.200 --> 00:05:31.620
This event will be held in order to select such a Divine Idol.

00:05:33.350 --> 00:05:34.620
Yay!

00:05:34.860 --> 00:05:36.520
Let's do it! You and me!

00:05:36.520 --> 00:05:39.050
Let's take the Divine Idol challenge!

00:05:39.050 --> 00:05:41.100
Di-vine! I-dol!

00:05:41.100 --> 00:05:41.450
... Grand Prix!

00:05:41.450 --> 00:05:42.630
Really? We can really become a Divine Idol?

00:05:42.630 --> 00:05:45.240
... Di-vine! I-dol! Grand Prix!

00:05:45.240 --> 00:05:47.210
A Divine Idol at last-gma!

00:05:47.210 --> 00:05:49.550
Will we see one born before us?
... Di-vine! I-dol! Grand Prix!

00:05:52.270 --> 00:05:55.450
The discussion at the Meganii Summit...

00:05:55.450 --> 00:05:57.800
was on where to hold the event.

00:05:58.790 --> 00:06:03.980
Not only SoLaMi SMILE and Dressing Pafé, in Parajuku are many idols

00:06:03.980 --> 00:06:06.350
who excel in both popularity and ability.

00:06:06.750 --> 00:06:08.510
But that is not all!

00:06:09.180 --> 00:06:14.070
Say they met a troubled girl, attending PriPara for the first time.

00:06:14.070 --> 00:06:17.830
With a "Ca-pi-sce"...

00:06:18.680 --> 00:06:20.840
They would show her the way.

00:06:21.680 --> 00:06:25.120
PriPara is a place where girls find happiness.

00:06:25.560 --> 00:06:27.750
In PriPara, you are among friends.

00:06:28.710 --> 00:06:30.570
"We're all friends...

00:06:30.570 --> 00:06:32.570
We're all idols!"

00:06:33.110 --> 00:06:36.870
Is this not the very soul of PriPara?

00:06:48.100 --> 00:06:49.910
Parajuku!

00:06:49.910 --> 00:06:50.810
Bravo!

00:06:50.810 --> 00:06:51.640
Grande!

00:06:51.640 --> 00:06:54.240
Parajuku!

00:06:54.240 --> 00:06:54.440
Emotion!

00:06:54.440 --> 00:06:55.320
Parajuku!

00:06:55.320 --> 00:06:57.840
That little piece was truly heartwarming.

00:07:00.310 --> 00:07:03.670
Aha, it seems the system has made its decision.

00:07:04.040 --> 00:07:05.880
Let's take a gander at the hologrammation!

00:07:06.500 --> 00:07:08.760
The grounds for this Grand Prix are...

00:07:10.070 --> 00:07:10.990
Parajuku!

00:07:15.850 --> 00:07:16.420
Yay!

00:07:16.420 --> 00:07:17.540
And so...

00:07:18.010 --> 00:07:21.100
as Parajuku has been designated
the location of the event,

00:07:21.100 --> 00:07:23.980
a system update has been effected.

00:07:24.660 --> 00:07:29.800
And you're saying if we participate, we can become Divine Idols?

00:07:30.040 --> 00:07:33.910
Indeed. Unlike advancing one's rank in the regular manner,

00:07:33.910 --> 00:07:37.460
to reach this highest peak involves a different mechanism.

00:07:37.770 --> 00:07:41.130
And now, the path to advance to this rank has opened.

00:07:41.910 --> 00:07:44.960
Question! How do we become a Divine Idol?

00:07:45.800 --> 00:07:48.840
Firstly, you must participate in the Grand Prix,

00:07:48.840 --> 00:07:52.620
and free Divine Coords sealed within this statue.

00:07:53.580 --> 00:07:54.600
Divine Coords?

00:07:55.690 --> 00:08:00.000
When all the Divine Coords adorning this statue have been freed,

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:02.780
the final preparations will
have been put into place.

00:08:03.270 --> 00:08:05.280
What does it mean to "free" a Divine Coord?

00:08:05.280 --> 00:08:07.080
When's this Grand Prix starting?

00:08:07.080 --> 00:08:09.260
Why did the microphone change?

00:08:10.060 --> 00:08:13.220
The specifics will be fully detailed later, so look forward to it.

00:08:13.870 --> 00:08:16.870
Oh, yes, and there is one more present for you all.

00:08:20.470 --> 00:08:22.520
Oh wow, it's so cute!

00:08:22.520 --> 00:08:24.520
This is the Closet Trunk.

00:08:24.520 --> 00:08:27.780
You can keep and organise your PriTickets and Friend Tickets.

00:08:28.820 --> 00:08:31.950
Ensure you bring it to your concerts as well.

00:08:32.300 --> 00:08:33.990
Thank you-pri!

00:08:34.090 --> 00:08:35.750
Um... Meganii-san.

00:08:35.950 --> 00:08:38.960
Is anyone allowed to compete in the Grand Prix?

00:08:39.480 --> 00:08:41.670
You can await her word on that.

00:08:42.180 --> 00:08:42.990
"Her"?

00:08:43.870 --> 00:08:45.370
I'm referring to Jewlie.

00:08:45.900 --> 00:08:48.470
She holds the key to bringing forth a Divine Idol.

00:08:49.240 --> 00:08:53.040
By this time, she will have alighted in our PriPara.

00:08:53.950 --> 00:08:54.660
Jewlie...

00:08:55.050 --> 00:08:57.680
The key to bring forth a Divine Idol...

00:08:57.850 --> 00:09:01.120
Meganii-san! I have important news regarding the system.

00:09:03.590 --> 00:09:04.220
I see.

00:09:05.340 --> 00:09:06.850
Well then, everyone – <i>ciao</i>!

00:09:08.380 --> 00:09:09.720
And there he goes.

00:09:12.020 --> 00:09:15.050
We'll reach Divine Idol, come hell or high water!

00:09:15.140 --> 00:09:16.350
Which reminds me!

00:09:16.350 --> 00:09:20.810
I can finally spend my hibernation in a 7LDK cave!

00:09:20.810 --> 00:09:23.780
I'll be living it up in glitz and glamour!

00:09:23.920 --> 00:09:24.680
Capisce!

00:09:24.680 --> 00:09:28.630
We'll totally, absolutely, become perfect Divine Idols!

00:09:28.840 --> 00:09:30.680
We'll work hard and take first place!

00:09:31.180 --> 00:09:32.670
Divine Idol...

00:09:32.670 --> 00:09:34.660
Just thinking about it is like...

00:09:34.660 --> 00:09:35.840
Pshuu...

00:09:35.840 --> 00:09:38.830
The time of Dressing Pafé has come!

00:09:38.830 --> 00:09:42.220
No gods before us! We shall stand above all others!

00:09:42.220 --> 00:09:44.600
Tension max to the max!

00:09:44.600 --> 00:09:45.810
Relax!

00:09:46.300 --> 00:09:49.350
We'll step up our training even more from tomorrow!

00:09:49.530 --> 00:09:50.480
Divine Idol...

00:09:50.480 --> 00:09:51.860
Which is to say a deity!

00:09:52.150 --> 00:09:53.980
A status befitting Toudou Shion!

00:09:56.250 --> 00:09:58.990
The devil shall take the divine throne!

00:09:58.990 --> 00:10:02.750
If I'm a Divine Idol, I can eat
all the delicious snacks I want!

00:10:03.020 --> 00:10:04.460
We shall not fail.

00:10:04.460 --> 00:10:05.310
Yep!

00:10:08.340 --> 00:10:11.130
So what was with that baby after all?

00:10:13.640 --> 00:10:15.290
Gah – the baby's back!

00:10:16.260 --> 00:10:17.370
What about a baby?

00:10:17.600 --> 00:10:19.370
What? Wait, where...?

00:10:19.930 --> 00:10:22.340
What are you talking about? Let's get going.

00:10:28.740 --> 00:10:31.100
Hey! You guys! Look, she's right here!

00:10:33.260 --> 00:10:34.470
There's nothing there.

00:10:35.180 --> 00:10:36.470
Will you give it a rest?

00:10:36.760 --> 00:10:37.800
Hey, but...

00:10:38.580 --> 00:10:40.320
Let's go home, Lala.

00:10:42.020 --> 00:10:43.880
Ca–Capisce...

00:10:44.580 --> 00:10:45.830
How weird...

00:10:45.830 --> 00:10:47.830
<i>You're</i> the weird one here...

00:10:47.830 --> 00:10:48.510
No babies around here...

00:10:48.510 --> 00:10:49.640
Did I hear that right?

00:10:49.640 --> 00:10:51.520
Jewlie hasn't arrived?

00:10:51.520 --> 00:10:52.120
That's right!

00:10:52.460 --> 00:10:56.550
We've searched high and low, but we found no one who could be Jewlie.

00:10:57.270 --> 00:10:58.750
That can't be!

00:10:58.750 --> 00:10:59.760
This is terrible!

00:11:11.180 --> 00:11:13.690
Bye then, Sophie, Head Disciplinarian Minami.

00:11:13.910 --> 00:11:14.750
See you, Lala.

00:11:14.750 --> 00:11:16.580
High-intensity training starts tomorrow.

00:11:16.580 --> 00:11:17.520
Capisce!

00:11:20.820 --> 00:11:23.860
<i>Still, though, what was the deal with that baby?</i>

00:11:23.860 --> 00:11:24.740
Mama!

00:11:26.410 --> 00:11:28.560
What? Where is she?

00:11:29.530 --> 00:11:31.750
Mama.

00:11:32.320 --> 00:11:33.370
When'd this get here?

00:11:33.900 --> 00:11:35.130
Was it coming from this?

00:11:38.310 --> 00:11:39.270
Mama!

00:11:39.450 --> 00:11:40.480
Huh?!

00:11:40.480 --> 00:11:41.860
Why are you in there?

00:11:41.860 --> 00:11:43.870
No, <i>how</i> did you get in there?

00:11:43.870 --> 00:11:45.380
...GET IN THERE?

00:11:49.350 --> 00:11:51.000
No, don't cry!

00:11:52.740 --> 00:11:54.680
Where's the baby? There she is!

00:11:55.930 --> 00:11:58.700
That girl's making weird faces and talking to herself.

00:11:59.220 --> 00:12:00.570
Do you think she's ill?

00:12:06.720 --> 00:12:08.760
What are <i>you</i> crying for? I'm the one...

00:12:11.720 --> 00:12:14.040
She popped out of the compact again!

00:12:20.720 --> 00:12:23.300
She might be even louder than me...

00:12:24.120 --> 00:12:25.930
What are you crying for?

00:12:25.930 --> 00:12:28.350
Are you sad? Does it hurt somewhere?

00:12:29.040 --> 00:12:31.400
Maybe if I ask Mum, she'll know!

00:12:33.180 --> 00:12:34.150
I'm home!

00:12:34.420 --> 00:12:35.640
Mum, can I ask you...

00:12:35.640 --> 00:12:37.380
Here, your lasagne.

00:12:37.380 --> 00:12:39.200
I'll bring the pasta over right away.

00:12:39.480 --> 00:12:41.920
The cheese pizza for table 4 is ready to go-ghurt!

00:12:42.020 --> 00:12:42.710
Got it!

00:12:43.390 --> 00:12:44.460
Are you ready to order?

00:12:44.920 --> 00:12:46.040
I'll be right back.

00:12:46.040 --> 00:12:48.040
<i>Man, they seem really busy...</i>

00:12:51.560 --> 00:12:53.060
Huh? What?

00:12:53.630 --> 00:12:54.670
Did you take it?

00:12:56.970 --> 00:12:57.460
Hey!

00:13:01.760 --> 00:13:03.510
It–It wasn't me, I swear!

00:13:03.640 --> 00:13:05.840
Oh, Lala, I didn't see you. Welcome back.

00:13:06.150 --> 00:13:07.600
Great timing, darling.

00:13:07.600 --> 00:13:09.440
Can you run out and grab a bag of tomatoes?

00:13:10.080 --> 00:13:11.540
C-Capisce!

00:13:13.350 --> 00:13:15.680
Maybe she was just hungry...

00:13:16.160 --> 00:13:18.780
Um, is this the right kind of milk?

00:13:18.780 --> 00:13:19.520
Eh?

00:13:20.240 --> 00:13:21.700
Capisce, I'm home!

00:13:21.930 --> 00:13:23.290
The tomatoes are on the counter.

00:13:23.290 --> 00:13:24.440
Thanks, Lala!

00:13:27.220 --> 00:13:30.300
All right, how do I do this exactly...

00:13:31.060 --> 00:13:32.800
Is it mixed through?

00:13:33.140 --> 00:13:34.620
Did I make it too thick?

00:13:34.620 --> 00:13:35.960
Is it too hot?

00:13:37.600 --> 00:13:39.020
Ah! She popped out again!

00:13:39.550 --> 00:13:41.770
This baby is <i>not</i> normal!

00:13:42.270 --> 00:13:44.350
Onee-chan, will you keep it down?

00:13:44.350 --> 00:13:45.820
Shouting and crying...

00:13:45.820 --> 00:13:46.590
Non!

00:13:47.100 --> 00:13:49.390
What? Is that a <i>baby</i>?

00:13:50.080 --> 00:13:52.310
You didn't tell me you were a mum, Onee-chan!

00:13:52.310 --> 00:13:55.230
What're you talkin' about?!
How could a primary schooler could be a mother!

00:13:55.230 --> 00:13:57.420
I've always wanted a little sister!

00:13:57.420 --> 00:14:00.390
I mean, she'll be my niece,
but we can call her a little sister.

00:14:00.390 --> 00:14:01.210
You're missing the point!

00:14:01.210 --> 00:14:01.880
Mama!

00:14:02.390 --> 00:14:04.040
She just called you "Mama".

00:14:04.040 --> 00:14:06.030
Well, yeah, but it's not like that!

00:14:08.540 --> 00:14:09.520
Capisce!

00:14:09.520 --> 00:14:11.400
I'll feed you right away.

00:14:11.750 --> 00:14:12.640
Um, so...

00:14:12.640 --> 00:14:13.950
Give it here, Onee-chan.

00:14:18.800 --> 00:14:20.070
She's drinking it!

00:14:20.540 --> 00:14:23.850
I'm impressed you were able to make it so well.

00:14:24.790 --> 00:14:26.520
My friend's parents have a new baby

00:14:26.520 --> 00:14:28.390
and I sometimes help out when I visit.

00:14:29.040 --> 00:14:30.410
You can ask me anything!

00:14:33.590 --> 00:14:34.540
What now?

00:14:34.730 --> 00:14:36.120
What's wrong?

00:14:37.020 --> 00:14:38.830
She looks kind of strained.

00:14:40.280 --> 00:14:41.230
Up you go.

00:14:42.060 --> 00:14:43.770
Come on, burp it out.

00:14:45.760 --> 00:14:47.680
So that's what you do...

00:14:48.070 --> 00:14:50.060
Babies can't talk, you know.

00:14:50.440 --> 00:14:53.400
You have to listen closely to figure out what they want.

00:14:53.870 --> 00:14:55.400
C–Capisce...

00:14:57.740 --> 00:14:59.440
What a mysterious kid, though.

00:15:00.250 --> 00:15:01.720
What should I do?

00:15:01.720 --> 00:15:04.880
I guess I'll ask Head Disciplinarian Minami and the others for help...

00:15:05.670 --> 00:15:06.720
No, you can't do that!

00:15:07.130 --> 00:15:08.790
You're an <i>idol</i>, Onee-chan!

00:15:08.790 --> 00:15:11.300
If word got out that you had a baby...

00:15:11.940 --> 00:15:14.460
Really? Sweet little Lala has a baby?

00:15:14.460 --> 00:15:16.070
Who could the father be?

00:15:16.070 --> 00:15:18.470
It's gotta be that bear. There's no doubt about it!

00:15:18.470 --> 00:15:19.660
That's the worst.

00:15:19.660 --> 00:15:20.440
It's the best!

00:15:20.440 --> 00:15:24.070
I can't believe it, an idol with a baby... and she's still in primary school!

00:15:24.070 --> 00:15:27.270
Guess she's never heard of
"propriety". I'm done being her fan.

00:15:27.700 --> 00:15:29.690
You have failed as an idol.

00:15:29.690 --> 00:15:31.860
You will be sent to the mascot graveyard.

00:15:32.340 --> 00:15:33.750
That's the system!

00:15:34.230 --> 00:15:38.500
Woe is me, woe is me...

00:15:38.500 --> 00:15:41.300
Mama...
Woe is me, woe is me...

00:15:41.300 --> 00:15:41.310
Woe is me, woe is me...

00:15:42.000 --> 00:15:43.590
... it'll totally be like that!

00:15:44.000 --> 00:15:46.380
It–It will?

